{"product_id":"high-tide-in-hawaii","title":"High Tide in Hawaii","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe #1 bestselling chapter book series of all time celebrates 25 years with new covers and a new, easy-to-use numbering system! Catch the wave! That's what Jack and Annie do when the Magic Tree House whisks them back to a Hawaiian island of long ago. They learn how to surf and have a great time—until strange things start happening. Jack and Annie soon discover the cause: A tidal wave is headed their way! Can they help save their new friends in time? Did you know that there’s a Magic Tree House book for every kid? Magic Tree House: Adventures with Jack and Annie, perfect for readers who are just beginning chapter books Merlin Missions: More challenging adventures for the experienced reader Super Edition: A longer and more dangerous adventure Fact Trackers: Nonfiction companions to your favorite Magic Tree House adventures\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mary Pope Osborne\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375806162\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898400301209,"sku":"17RE-2-9780375806162","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691822452b990_High_Tide_in_Hawaii.jpg?v=1763202653","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/high-tide-in-hawaii","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}